  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div class=\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, ;\" system-ui\",=\"\" \".sfnstext-regular\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\" id=\"isPasted\">REEFLEX is a dynamic team of tech enthusiasts - engineers, designers, and photographers - hailing from the vibrant cities of Rome, Zurich, and Copenhagen.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-cap